{"id":"6827c3d062aa9110","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-godel-first.md","title":"Gödel Incompleteness Theorem","display":"thm-godel-first — Gödel Incompleteness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-godel-first","aliases":["57-thm-godel-first"],"display":"thm-godel-first — Gödel Incompleteness Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-arity]]","[[57-df-maxcon]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-S-ar]]","[[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]","[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-consistency]]","[[57-df-recursive-axiomatizability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-godel-first"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-godel-first</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-godel-first — Gödel Incompleteness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e892c7a9bb01feb5\" href=\"?note=e892c7a9bb01feb5\" title=\"57-df-maxcon\">57-df-maxcon</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cd1d3a421d8f589e\" href=\"?note=cd1d3a421d8f589e\" title=\"57-df-robinson-arithmetic\">57-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c3d5023e5f50e6a0\" href=\"?note=c3d5023e5f50e6a0\" title=\"57-df-consistency\">57-df-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f09872a0e6f9cd1a\" href=\"?note=f09872a0e6f9cd1a\" title=\"57-df-recursive-axiomatizability\">57-df-recursive-axiomatizability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}\">\\(Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"cd1d3a421d8f589e\" href=\"?note=cd1d3a421d8f589e\" title=\"57-df-robinson-arithmetic\">57-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 指 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a> 的标准一阶 Hilbert 推导；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot=\\neg\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0)\">\\(\\bot=\\neg\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"c3d5023e5f50e6a0\" href=\"?note=c3d5023e5f50e6a0\" title=\"57-df-consistency\">57-df-consistency</a>，并使用标准 Hilbert 与经典矢列演算的等价读法。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecAx}(T)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"f09872a0e6f9cd1a\" href=\"?note=f09872a0e6f9cd1a\" title=\"57-df-recursive-axiomatizability\">57-df-recursive-axiomatizability</a>；它要求存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 同模型的递归公理集，而非任意理论都满足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\land\\mathrm{RecAx}(T)\\to\n\\exists \\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\;(T\\nvdash \\sigma\\land T\\nvdash\\neg \\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\land\\mathrm{RecAx}(T)\\to\n\\exists \\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\;(T\\nvdash \\sigma\\land T\\nvdash\\neg \\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留句子独立性的结论，补上原来缺失的一致性和有效公理化前提。对于只假设一致性的双向不可证结论，采用 Rosser 型强度，不把它错误归因于任意 Gödel 句。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arity]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-maxcon","status":"resolved","id":"e892c7a9bb01feb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-maxcon]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-S-ar","status":"resolved","id":"6e637b613a7ac0c5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-S-ar]]","embed":false